# Accessibility audit: Dialog (2026-11-16)

Scope: `spec/components/dialog/contract.json` + `contract.md`, `src/components/dialog/*` (Dialog, Trigger, Content, Header, Footer, Title, Description, Close, `context.ts`, `Dialog.scss`), `playwright/tests/dialog/*` (spec and `__screen-reader__` views). Standard: WCAG 2.2 AA and the WAI-ARIA APG Dialog (Modal) pattern. Parity audit 2026-11-12 open items re-checked below. Manual screen-reader passes are replaced by check S1 and Chromium AX-tree inspection (Q6, SB-0113).

